/**
 * Nous: Nous Research characters as video game heroes, in tributes to the big releases (an 80s open-world set and a high-fantasy MMO set), themes for the Hermes desktop app in light and dark.
 * https://github.com/Adolanium/hermes-nous
 *
 * Each theme is a palette, a few style values and three painted images in the
 * style of an 80s game loading screen, registered through the Desktop plugin
 * SDK. IBM Plex and each theme's display face are bundled (SIL OFL, see
 * LICENSES/), so the plugin makes no network requests.
 *
 * Every selector below is app DOM (data-slot / data-tree-* names), not SDK
 * API. If a Desktop update renames one, that piece of the look falls back to
 * the plain palette rather than breaking anything.
 */

